<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jefferson Smurfit started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jefferson Smurfit started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Richard Schneider initiated coverage of Jefferson Smurfit Group as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Jefferson Smurfit gained 1-1/4 to 33-1/4 in morning trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
